The HX-520 is within its documented pump-body operating envelope for 132°C, 9 bar and 55 m³/h. The standard hygienic EPDM seal is recommended up to 125°C continuous, so we would specify the hygienic FKM seal for this duty.

We would still validate the final duty point and cleaning regime before issue of the binding configuration.

